<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Servgro yr sustainable income leaps 62 pct.</title>
<headline>Servgro yr sustainable income leaps 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - sustainable inc.    122.5	 vs     75.5</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)   nil making 15.0 vs     28.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   156.7	 vs     25.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   249.6	 vs    112.1</p>
<p>    Tax			  71.0	 vs     52.6</p>
